# Serena's local state: a per-developer override file and a regenerable cache.
.serena/project.local.yml
.serena/cache/

# Agent worktrees of this repository. Each is a full checkout carrying its own
# copy of `biome.jsonc`, and Biome refuses a root configuration nested inside
# another, so `npm run lint` fails outright for as long as one exists. Biome
# reads this file, which is why the entry belongs here rather than in its
# `files.includes`: one exclusion then covers every tool that walks the tree.
.claude/worktrees/
